# AiChart cron jobs — replace YOUR_DOMAIN and CRON_SECRET
# Event-driven monitoring: pure-code scan via cron; the OpenClaw heartbeat only
# reviews open-trade theses hourly (agent/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md).

# 24/7 market monitor every 30 min — deep AI runs only when candidates appear.
*/30 * * * * curl -sS -X POST -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CRON_SECRET" https://YOUR_DOMAIN/api/cron/monitor

# Daily Telegram summary at 20:00 UTC
0 20 * * * curl -sS -X POST -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CRON_SECRET" https://YOUR_DOMAIN/api/cron/daily-summary
